sich für Familien. Ein kleiner Garten, dem ein neuer Zaun gehört, lädt zum Verweilen ein. Sämtliche Nebenkosten werden transparent aufgelistet. Obwohl der Preis fair ist, sollten Interessenten sich schnell melden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Wohnungsanzeige und E-Mail","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Grit, hast du den Vermieter schon angerufen wegen des Vertrags?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ja, obwohl die Nebenkosten hoch sind, will ich die Wohnung trotzdem nehmen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Wirklich?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Das überrascht mich ein bisschen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Ich weiß, aber die Lage ist einfach zu gut.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Ich unterschreibe morgen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Grit, hast du den Vermieter schon angerufen wegen des Vertrags?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ja, obwohl die Nebenkosten hoch sind, will ich die Wohnung trotzdem nehmen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Wirklich? Das überrascht mich ein bisschen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Ich weiß, aber die Lage ist einfach zu gut. Ich unterschreibe morgen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_013_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich habe den Vermieter angerufen, obwohl die Wohnung schon vergeben war.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Prüfung, Teil 1: Erzähl von deiner Wohnungssuche.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Wegen der Lage nehme ich sie, obwohl die Miete hoch ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-13-goethe-mini-2","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Partnerin fragt, warum du die Wohnung trotzdem nimmst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type"